## before: brief, in a Claude Code session
Listening: run `handoff wait --for reviewer --timeout 25m` (in Claude Code in the background, in Codex in the foreground of your turn). Exit 3: run it again. Exit 4: another session already listens for reviewer. After you handle what it delivers, wait again.
## before: brief, in a Codex session
Listening: run `handoff wait --for reviewer --timeout 25m` (in Claude Code in the background, in Codex in the foreground of your turn). Exit 3: run it again. Exit 4: another session already listens for reviewer. After you handle what it delivers, wait again.
## before: brief, outside a session
Listening: run `handoff wait --for reviewer --timeout 25m` (in Claude Code in the background, in Codex in the foreground of your turn). Exit 3: run it again. Exit 4: another session already listens for reviewer. After you handle what it delivers, wait again.
## before: role, in a Claude Code session
Listening: if this project's settings give your session handoff's hooks, a hook listens for implementer when your turn ends, and you don't run wait. If not, run `handoff wait --for implementer --timeout 25m` (in Claude Code in the background, in Codex in the foreground of your turn). Exit 3: run it again. Exit 4: another session already listens for implementer. After you handle what it delivers, wait again.
## before: role, in a Codex session
Listening: if this project's settings give your session handoff's hooks, a hook listens for reviewer-2 when your turn ends, and you don't run wait. If not, run `handoff wait --for reviewer-2 --timeout 25m` (in Claude Code in the background, in Codex in the foreground of your turn). Exit 3: run it again. Exit 4: another session already listens for reviewer-2. After you handle what it delivers, wait again.
## before: hook brief, as a hook gives it
Listening: you don't run `handoff wait`. When your turn ends, a hook listens for reviewer and brings you what arrives.
